    ViewData["Description"] = "There is no average badminton sub, because clubs sell two different products. We probed 923 UK club websites: only 16% state a price at all. Of those that do, an all-in season sub sits around £160 and a pay-per-session club charges about £30 a year plus £3.50 to £12 a night. They are two different products, not one price range.";
    ViewData["OgTitle"] = "What UK badminton clubs charge in subs";

    const string published = "2026-08-26";
    const string canonical = "https://www.epegboard.com/guides/setting-club-subs";

    // QUESTION SET (production step 1) - each is an H2 below:
